      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIERCE LUVA (3) profiles strongly, coming off two wins, including a BM60 at this track where he overcame a bad start to win comfortably in the end. Winning hoop sticks and he's still improving. Can win again. HE'S A SAINT (5) deserves respect after just missing on the course proper here, where a slow start didn't stop him from finishing strong, ultimately losing by a nose. His prior BM60 sixth was deceptive, making good late ground after again being slowly away. With weight relief, he gets his chance to break a long run of outs. LA ROSETTA (1) comes through stronger contests, rebounding strongly last time when finishing third on the course proper. Her 3kg claim helps offset the weight and he's right in the mix. SMELTER (9) improved to finish third in a CL1 at Lismore at odds, and while the competition is tougher, his light weight gives him a chance to make his presence felt.",
